{"type":"json_object","message":"I interpret the question as asking for the 2006 versus 2005 change in the product warranty reserve. The source states the reserve was $10 million in 2006 and $4 million in 2005. I will calculate the change as 2006 reserve minus 2005 reserve, with no unit conversion needed since both amounts are already in millions of USD.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"10 - 4","variables":{"reserve_2006":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"USD_million"},"reserve_2005":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"reserve_2006":"source:q11n3","reserve_2005":"source:q11n4"}}}